SlugYard is a substantially modified version of NuvioTV.

Original project: NuvioTV
Copyright: NuvioTV contributors
Source: https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioTV

SlugYard includes extensive changes to the Android TV interface, branding,
catalog presentation, playback behavior, debrid integration, subtitle support,
and application settings. These changes are maintained by the SlugYard project.

